{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "CoopRooms",
    "steam_appid": 3630010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/41c141fd2231272d54c80dbd9603aa5c.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/8aa26885703530c53cfab48bea273b37.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/8aa26885703530c53cfab48bea273b37.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/8aa26885703530c53cfab48bea273b37.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is best enjoyed with friends: Fall into the Backrooms with\u00a0<strong>1-5 players</strong>\u00a0and use <strong>proximity voice chat</strong> to communicate! Make sure to not lose each other, or you won't hear your friends anymore... Don't worry <i><strong>they</strong></i><strong> </strong>will always hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/217d0e34ac6590d079c3474a67bb563a.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/6146c4cdca6e6fd4e7af30b4a9236f39.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/6146c4cdca6e6fd4e7af30b4a9236f39.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/6146c4cdca6e6fd4e7af30b4a9236f39.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters don\u2019t just hunt you\u2014they <strong>hear</strong> you. Unlike most other Backrooms games, <strong>the enemies react to your real voice</strong>. Your microphone becomes a tool for survival, don't scream too loud!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/c30888848183698e32c750d4fb6907ae.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/67961c9e3d216144f9c4ca608d802e3d.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/67961c9e3d216144f9c4ca608d802e3d.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/67961c9e3d216144f9c4ca608d802e3d.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with the currently available most recent version of\u00a0<strong>Unreal Engine 5, </strong>expect realistic visuals feeling like you're looking through an old camera.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/8d050fed3d27c0d59d701b6cd668160a.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing stays the same. Every time you enter the backrooms, the map is <strong>randomly</strong> <strong>generated</strong>, ensuring that no two playthroughs are never the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/61678614d6fbb36e58b39bda6f4a938c.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/fbafb8a084bd9bc906c9f0a19912ac5d.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/fbafb8a084bd9bc906c9f0a19912ac5d.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/fbafb8a084bd9bc906c9f0a19912ac5d.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles together to escape from the Backrooms - some demand more teamwork than others. Puzzles will dynamically adjust to the number of players during runtime, so you will need your friends that are currently in the Backrooms with you and even if they leave, you can keep going!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/18dec378bfc3792b76d6b69e9e8a3393.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/72b894e742fc578c1af34c3a2a0d1c91.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/72b894e742fc578c1af34c3a2a0d1c91.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/72b894e742fc578c1af34c3a2a0d1c91.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CoopRooms</strong> requires you not only to escape the Backrooms, but also to <strong>record your experience</strong> using a camera available to your group. You will need successful escapes in combination with good recordings to progress to the next level of the Backrooms. You will be able to watch your experience in the case of a failure, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/116651714b1f5c7612942eb8efa59a8c.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/674e364649f3c712fdc4e896cfd996b3.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/674e364649f3c712fdc4e896cfd996b3.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/674e364649f3c712fdc4e896cfd996b3.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objectives will need a brave player to <strong>take specific photos</strong>. Every picture you take inside the Backrooms will be <strong>saved locally for each player</strong> and also shown in the <strong>lobby gallery</strong> for everyone to view. Whether it\u2019s proof of something terrifying or a funny team moment, your shots become part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/5d4e3e44ca4e01dbf7a37750ee4ebba3.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/da3514cadccffbdb64ece1b47fced453.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/da3514cadccffbdb64ece1b47fced453.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/da3514cadccffbdb64ece1b47fced453.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>CoopRooms</strong>, getting caught by an entity doesn't mean game over. Instead, you\u2019ll return as a <strong>drone</strong>\u2014a floating presence that can <strong>move freely</strong>, <strong>communicate with your team using proximity voice chat</strong>, and even <strong>assist your friends</strong> in escaping\u2026 or, if you\u2019re feeling a little funny, you could choose to <strong>help the entities instead.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/41c141fd2231272d54c80dbd9603aa5c.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/8aa26885703530c53cfab48bea273b37.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/8aa26885703530c53cfab48bea273b37.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/8aa26885703530c53cfab48bea273b37.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is best enjoyed with friends: Fall into the Backrooms with\u00a0<strong>1-5 players</strong>\u00a0and use <strong>proximity voice chat</strong> to communicate! Make sure to not lose each other, or you won't hear your friends anymore... Don't worry <i><strong>they</strong></i><strong> </strong>will always hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/217d0e34ac6590d079c3474a67bb563a.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/6146c4cdca6e6fd4e7af30b4a9236f39.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/6146c4cdca6e6fd4e7af30b4a9236f39.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"