source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/72b894e742fc578c1af34c3a2a0d1c91.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/72b894e742fc578c1af34c3a2a0d1c91.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CoopRooms</strong> requires you not only to escape the Backrooms, but also to <strong>record your experience</strong> using a camera available to your group. You will need successful escapes in combination with good recordings to progress to the next level of the Backrooms. You will be able to watch your experience in the case of a failure, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/116651714b1f5c7612942eb8efa59a8c.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/674e364649f3c712fdc4e896cfd996b3.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/674e364649f3c712fdc4e896cfd996b3.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/674e364649f3c712fdc4e896cfd996b3.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objectives will need a brave player to <strong>take specific photos</strong>. Every picture you take inside the Backrooms will be <strong>saved locally for each player</strong> and also shown in the <strong>lobby gallery</strong> for everyone to view. Whether it\u2019s proof of something terrifying or a funny team moment, your shots become part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/5d4e3e44ca4e01dbf7a37750ee4ebba3.webp?t=1747882836\" width=800 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/da3514cadccffbdb64ece1b47fced453.poster.avif?t=1747882836\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/da3514cadccffbdb64ece1b47fced453.webm?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630010/extras/da3514cadccffbdb64ece1b47fced453.mp4?t=1747882836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>CoopRooms</strong>, getting caught by an entity doesn't mean game over. Instead, you\u2019ll return as a <strong>drone</strong>\u2014a floating presence that can <strong>move freely</strong>, <strong>communicate with your team using proximity voice chat</strong>, and even <strong>assist your friends</strong> in escaping\u2026 or, if you\u2019re feeling a little funny, you could choose to <strong>help the entities instead.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "CoopRooms is a co-op survival horror game for up to 5 players, set in the endless Backrooms. Take photos and videos to progress\u2014and maybe survive. Just don\u2019t scream... the Entities are listening.",
